    "### Puzzle: Optimize List Comprehension\n",
    "Refactor the function using list comprehension."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "4",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def square_list(n):\n    result = []\n    for i in range(n+1):\n        result.append(i*i)\n    return result"
   ]
  },

  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "2",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(square_list(3)) # expected output: [0, 1, 4, 9]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
